\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The golden gates are lifted up,
\par The doors are opened wide;
\par The King of Glory is gone in
\par Unto His Father's Side.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou art gone up before us, Lord,
\par To make for us a place,
\par That we may be where now thou art,
\par And look upon God's face.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. And ever on our earthly path
\par A gleam of glory lies;
\par A light still breaks behind the cloud
\par That veiled Thee from our eyes.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Lift up our hearts, lift up our minds:
\par Let Thy dear grace be given,
\par That, while we wonder here below,
\par Our treasure be in heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. That where Thou art at God's right hand
\par Our hope, our love, may be.
\par Dwell Thou in us, that we may dwell
\par For evermore in Thee.  
\par                          Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
